===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|Ixion|Ixīōn|lang=la}} from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|Ἰξίων|tr=Iksiōn|lang=grc|sc=polytonic}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|ĭk'sē-ŏn'}}

===Proper noun===
'''Ixion'''

# A [[Greek myth]] that was one of the [[Lapithes]]
# A [[Kuiper Belt Object]] ([[KBO]]), 28978 Ixion (provisional designation '''2001 KX<sub>76</sub>''')

